exports[`request letter (FR-REQ-01/02) > matches the reviewed text (snapshot) 1`] = `
"Setu Records
Request for copies of medical records
Date: 2 Nov 2026
To,
The Medical Records Department
City Hospital, Jaipur
Subject: Request for copies of medical records
Dear Sir or Madam,
I request copies of the following records of the patient named below, from your hospital:
Hospital discharge summary
Indoor (in-patient) case records
Laboratory report (tissue)
Scan report
Patient name
Sunita Devi
Date of birth
14 May 1972
Hospital ID (UHID / MRN)
UHID 44812
Period of care: 1 Mar 2026 to 30 Apr 2026
For reference: the regulations provide for indoor records to be issued within 72 hours of a request (IMC Regulation 1.3.2).
The copies may be handed to me or to the person signing below. I will add them to my records using the code printed here.
Return channel: scan to add the copies to the patient’s records
Thank you for your help.
Signature of patient or caregiver
Name
Relation to patient (write “self” if you are the patient)
Date
Request reference 0000ABCD · prepared with Setu Records"
`;

